  "description": "Syncfusion® ASP.NET Core Diagram control is a rich, interactive, and feature-complete diagramming library for building flowcharts, organizational charts, mind maps, network diagrams, BPMN diagrams, floor plans, and UML diagrams in web applications. It supports nodes, connectors, ports, swimlanes, complex layouts (hierarchical, radial, organizational), drag-and-drop, serialization, undo/redo, zooming, panning, and print/export capabilities. Ideal for workflow, process modeling, and visual design tools built on ASP.NET Core.",
